{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7a6d06c85e46222a7771d013796ca6b988533b97a01cb1b5860f0f4fca7f9fa4", "ja": "はは、どうしたんだ？\n急にかけ声なんかかけて。", "zh": "哈哈，你们怎么了？\n突然喊起口号来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "cf1f3c8728a47a5e7951f13d6d29be7563f669a4da0548a9ea420ef9e85f0367", "ja": "おや、これはいいところに～。\n{$P$}さんも、夢は決まってますか？", "zh": "哎呀，来得正好～\n{$P$}先生也有自己的梦想吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b39447a1836591f228175c332ac7be383e18b9d91d4c7a3ee03aef09e45de1f8", "ja": "えっ。俺の……夢？", "zh": "咦？我的……梦想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "59a2a7a435e1a3db48db4191677d306af9c70d4a587d7d9fa5991597d0789a67", "ja": "はい～。今、私の進路相談をしていたところなので、\n参考にさせてもらおうと思いまして～。", "zh": "是的～我们刚刚在讨论我的未来志愿，\n想说可以拿来当参考～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e76fecf7221b4618bbe698762c2f97082025de363313047a6c72c57b399767f7", "ja": "なるほど、そういうことか。\nでも、それならちょうど良かったよ。", "zh": "原来如此，是这么一回事啊。\n不过，那还真是刚好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9f2045829f48d2bb10fbe4ae96fd8751391d4ddb18e79f68622000e6cf60cf78", "ja": "じつは今、俺にはみんなのチカラでかなえて欲しい\n夢がある。そう、それは……。", "zh": "老实说，我现在就有个梦想\n希望能借助大家的力量去实现，那就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_1006", "source_sha256": "85272c4913235a16467a44663911e540f1cf688b422883e48ef7d1cda22402a2", "ja": "765プロ全体公演！", "zh": "765艺能全体公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2000_p", "source_sha256": "0ed8d52c95cbab371b6704fb9a52fc3757d67ca5c7c043e47b30928045f8f120", "ja": "この劇場で行う、765プロ全体公演だ！\n今さっき社長にOKをもらってきたぞ！", "zh": "在这座剧场中举行765艺能全体公演！\n我刚刚得到社长的首肯了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2001_027say", "source_sha256": "2e737d93baf079c962e4ff009cbe955075e5de32f4127ca15404ff2026fcbc2c", "ja": "765プロ全体公演！？", "zh": "765艺能全体公演！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2002_039kon", "source_sha256": "a864a67477b7c925102493dfeb03ced796a73a097f5d0dd4d8d8e4cd8dc89494", "ja": "766プロ全体公演！？", "zh": "765艺能全体公演！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2003_042miy", "source_sha256": "aac6b832ed9cc6c88a016fad555002062d2ca9a50a5132457dbd4f80cb94af5c", "ja": "おお～！", "zh": "哦哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2004_027say", "source_sha256": "45d2efe25501c0eeed3f5bb585f9e08ebd05d48e45cd5a2ba8422c3a6901319d", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか、{$P$}！？\n本当に765プロ全体で……52人全員で！？", "zh": "真、真的吗，{$P$}！？\n真的是765艺能全体……52个人一起！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2005_p", "source_sha256": "78b2af7c0979c6fd21f1da2d351f95cff70e5c94faddf22c063ec7e2ea2eb600", "ja": "ステージには交代で出てもらう形になるけどな。\nみんなで歌う新曲も用意してあるぞ！", "zh": "表演时大家会轮流上场就是了。\n还准备了大家一起唱的新歌喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2006_023aka", "source_sha256": "1ce36b82e2e81ef606dc4e7690b0221c2af17966490ed32639acafc56b2cd83a", "ja": "ニャハ☆　話はすべて聞かせてもらったよ、\n{$P$}ちゃん！", "zh": "喵哈☆这件事小茜全都听到了喔，\n小{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2007_048rei", "source_sha256": "4c900f38f4276ff6274dba2ffb6edc19d9ae3537187490c3d7449216e337ea9f", "ja": "わーいわーい♪　楽屋はきっとぎゅうぎゅうですね☆\nとっても楽しみです！", "zh": "耶～耶～♪休息室一定会挤得像沙丁鱼罐吧☆\n真令人期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2008_018ele", "source_sha256": "dbb06921f2697153616e9f55ae4a12c5efe60e67074a762138726246567e0652", "ja": "あはっ、みんなでカーニバルだネ！\n開演日が待ち遠しいヨ～♪", "zh": "啊哈，是要大家一起举办嘉年华吧！\n都快等不及开演那天到来了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2009_p", "source_sha256": "a2c7c18d707581650492dbd76a62bab0b70897509dee955f08a9ab82788722e7", "ja": "はは、3人とも気が早いな！\n……というか、いつの間に？", "zh": "哈哈，你们三个还真心急啊！\n……话说你们是什么时候来的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2010_046rio", "source_sha256": "276173804a908de3e3727617adfe08c45f282c8cee15a9d9dad84c9fb4ef2d6d", "ja": "とってもいい夢ね、{$P$}くん！\n私も早速、エステの予約しなくっちゃ♪", "zh": "这是一个很棒的梦想呢，{$P$}！\n我也得赶快去预约美容沙龙了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2011_038chz", "source_sha256": "9adc6d6575ec8e891d679fd706c6512685955defa22ae34209ccb30f5038b596", "ja": "全員で作る、ひとつのステージ……。\nふふっ、想像するだけで、夢が広がりますわ！", "zh": "所有人共同打造一个表演……\n呵呵，光是想像，就觉得梦想越来越远大了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2012_p", "source_sha256": "4a5bb6cab9d144c8c625370e3cc5259cf663d99100006e0b4fe05cb7e6873ea9", "ja": "（どんどん人が増えてるような……）", "zh": "（感觉人越来越多了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2013_p", "source_sha256": "bfe068db45042dd82e0c6f0257a95c7f3d7698cf23a34f28ea4d798b8e46f42e", "ja": "とにかく、今は公演に向けて、着々と準備を進めてる\nところだ。みんなも、しっかりレッスンするようにな！", "zh": "总而言之，现在公演的准备进行得十分顺利。\n大家也要认真练习喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2014_027say", "source_sha256": "9f7e6f285f803b3ac4763a46ac6ce641a2b345cf917c72a763ed435674adbdc0", "ja": "せっかくの全体公演です。私、また新しい限界に\n挑戦しますね！　でもその前に、まずは準備体操！", "zh": "难得能办一次全体公演，我要再挑战新的极限！\n不过在这之前，要先做暖身操！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2015_048rei", "source_sha256": "401a0932b685111fa69d74daae90a31526510f8b94c0dd74b01d3d1023a4f6ca", "ja": "はい、どんなに厳しい猛特訓メニューでも、\n茜ちゃんと一緒に頑張ります♪", "zh": "嗯，无论是多么严苛的猛烈特训，\n我都会跟小茜一起加油的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2016_023aka", "source_sha256": "71bed03d844828b626e6e7ee006df1d90fc9f7706a1dfba72dd9eabe5d7c0486", "ja": "おおっと、危険なフラグ立てないでね！\n茜ちゃん、ちゃんと普通に頑張る予定だから！", "zh": "哎呀呀，别插上这么危险的旗啦！\n小茜已经计划要正常地努力了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2017_042miy", "source_sha256": "789231d45fec98cfffcbb3ca630f5760e37abc1782b0bed2fda267532dc2a2eb", "ja": "むふふ～、なんだかお祭りみたいですね～。\nせっかくですから、劇場に屋台を出しましょう～。", "zh": "呵呵呵～总觉得好像祭典呢～\n趁这个难得的机会，我们在剧场里摆摊吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2018_018ele", "source_sha256": "27d69aa14ddac89bc5662e5f6145f3e0ecfde35b2e59b906351ffeed8e972fff", "ja": "久しぶりだから、ママン達も呼んじゃおうっと。\nきっとワタシ達と一緒に、ダンスしてくれるヨ！", "zh": "好久没办了，也叫妈妈他们来好了。\n他们一定也会跟我们一起跳舞的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2019_046rio", "source_sha256": "47304a7769af4d62959b65d062e47ccdaf51e78409accd5caa3b0ecf5d8280e2", "ja": "ファンの男の子達にも、ステキな夢を見せて\nあげなくちゃ。……もちろん、女の子達にもね♪", "zh": "也得为男粉丝们带来美好的梦想才行。\n……当然，女孩们也是♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2020_038chz", "source_sha256": "9435d9d17ca25dc2769137a9d857ff781e68f7472ac1f49d76d8cf02c9bef89a", "ja": "そうですわね。私たち全員の輝きを、ファンの皆さまに\n届けてみせますわ！　オーッホッホッホッホ！", "zh": "说得对，我们会让粉丝看见所有人的耀眼光芒！\n哦～呵呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2021_p", "source_sha256": "d362488de26659b3673202f681c3749195143a524bd9fbbee66966043291f0bd", "ja": "（うーん……。\nなんだか収まりがつかなくなってきたな）", "zh": "（嗯……\n感觉场面要控制不住了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2022_039kon", "source_sha256": "14b481709e70f2424db59c8d943b64c6d22195f3a64e50c7146194e052726e28", "ja": "みんな、{$P$}が困ってるわよ！\n久しぶりの全体公演で、盛り上がるのはわかるけど。", "zh": "各位，我们让{$P$}感到困扰了！\n我知道大家因为久违的全体公演，现在相当兴奋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2023_039kon", "source_sha256": "8012f729515329a1353e403e379c753c182ceb1c6194e04a226499e49097de61", "ja": "だからこそ、しっかり準備しないとね。そして、前より\n成長した私達の姿を、お客さんに見てもらいましょう！", "zh": "不过正因如此，更要好好准备才行。\n然后，让观众看看我们成长后的模样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_030_2024_027say", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
